    <fr:title text="Manavox Industries">Manavox Industries</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>The leader of Manavox Industries Wyla Welleck (sp?), a dwarf industrialist, is giving the inaugural keynote to
kick of the <fr:link href="/sss-004Q/" title="World Emporium" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-004Q/" display-uri="sss-004Q" type="local">World Emporium</fr:link>. She shows off technology to restore voices
to the mute; to "give voice to the voiceless". They claim this
addresses the damage caused by "Soma".</html:p>
    <html:p>They bring a kid on stage, Axon Mildew, and the demo seems to show
the voice box restoring his voice. Although he still sounds strained.</html:p>
    <html:p>A crowd of masked attackers overran the showcase. Chanting "hands
off our mouths".</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
